+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: triangular Waring deflation recovers the four hidden linear forms in "
+        "O(binomial(d+3,3)) exact coefficient operations; at the initial shipping preset "
+        "d=17 the selftest measures the wall time and operation count, whereas the "
+        "leading-slice route uses fewer than 300 exact operations but requires noticing "
+        "the hidden change of variables."
