Shipping uses degree 23. Bare, structural-hint, and placebo pools each solved 0/3. The reference Waring-deflation algorithm solves 8/8 as expected, while the compact route uses 10 coefficient lookups and 86 exact operations. The lower degree-17 rung was discarded after the structural hint enabled a valid solution.
